Package: dailoios-login-center
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: DaiLoiOS <support@dailoios.com>
Depends: dpkg, slick-greeter
Description: Center the DaiLoiOS login panel
 Configures Slick Greeter to place the login panel in the center of the screen
 while preserving the existing DaiLoiOS wallpaper and other greeter settings.
 Removing this package restores the previous configuration.
